"Later, Yelun knows Nathan Lark under the name 'Natad' while he hides in Giantsrest."
"When the Academy falls she flees Giantsrest with Roni, Hibor and the escaped slave Suse."
"She tries to smuggle Suse out, though Giantsrest executes escaped slaves."
"Roni dies to red-gold light as they flee."
"They slip away by stealth through the crops around Giantsrest, which takes most of a night."
